    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "α is a proposed arrow. σ(α) is the verb-phrase sentence that makes 'Every [domain-node] [verb-phrase] some [codomain-node]' true. ProposedArrow is the pre-gate arrow. TypedOlogArrow is the post-gate typed morphism in F_04." .

