silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_decomposition_step_1__step_forge_morphism_for_03_manifest_verification
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Pi is the declared manifest: the written Hom-profile declared before materialization. Y is the traced profile: the Yoneda-profile emitted by the runtime atom after installation. VerificationResult is the outcome of comparing Pi and Y." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_decomposition_step_2__step_forge_morphism_for_03_manifest_verification
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The verification morphism compares Pi and Y and produces one of four outcomes: COMMUTES (Pi=Y exactly, admit), PARTIAL (agree on core, diverge on some legs, admit with LEAK tag), DIVERGES (disagree on core legs, block), UNVERIFIABLE (Pi not declared before install, block)." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_decomposition_step_3__step_forge_morphism_for_03_manifest_verification
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Naturality of the Yoneda embedding ensures that the manifested profile and the traced profile must agree when the materialization was faithful." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_decomposition_step_4__step_forge_morphism_for_03_manifest_verification
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "COMMUTES: vet-record manifest Pi_vet (3 incoming + 2 outgoing) matches Y_vet exactly — full admission. PARTIAL: taxonomy Pi_tax (1 incoming) vs Y_tax (3 incoming) — admit with LEAK:2 tag. DIVERGES: a manifest claiming body-mass is a genus-level fact vs Y showing it is individual-level — block + NegReg. UNVERIFIABLE: a RuntimeAtom installed without a prior manifest declaration — block + require Pi backfill." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_decomposition_step_5__step_forge_morphism_for_03_manifest_verification
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The COMMUTES outcome is equivalent to the factorization square commuting: trace ∘ forge = match ∘ profile. This is the Yoneda-level equivalence between manifest verification and the factorization law." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_03_manifest_verification_decomposition_step_6__step_forge_morphism_for_03_manifest_verification
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Manifest verification checks Pi against Y and produces one of four outcomes; only COMMUTES admits the source without qualification." .

