silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_decomposition_step_1__step_forge_morphism_for_04_sous_observation_role
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Y^in_Mittens(X) = Hom(X, Mittens) is the incoming Yoneda profile functor. Y^out_Mittens(X) = Hom(Mittens, X) is the outgoing Yoneda profile functor. Together they are the sous position of Mittens in the Forge olog." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_decomposition_step_2__step_forge_morphism_for_04_sous_observation_role
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The pair (Y^in, Y^out) is the Yoneda embedding of Mittens into the functor category. Evaluating at an object X gives the set of Forge morphisms from X to Mittens (or from Mittens to X)." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_decomposition_step_3__step_forge_morphism_for_04_sous_observation_role
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The Yoneda lemma: an object is determined up to isomorphism by its representable functor." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_decomposition_step_4__step_forge_morphism_for_04_sous_observation_role
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The incoming profile at X=VetRecord: one admissible morphism (aboutness). The incoming profile at X=TaxonRow_catus: empty set (k1 blocks the direct path). The outgoing profile at X=DailyCareLog: one morphism (informs)." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_decomposition_step_5__step_forge_morphism_for_04_sous_observation_role
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "The sous position determines Mittens uniquely: two different objects with the same full Hom-profile are isomorphic. This is why the sous position is the Forge's identity-preservation mechanism: as long as the full profile is maintained (neither side collapsed nor conflated), the object is uniquely determined." .

silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_04_sous_observation_role_decomposition_step_6__step_forge_morphism_for_04_sous_observation_role
    a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Sous observes the Yoneda profile; it is not the object, not the source authority, and not a shortcut from generated witness to claim." .

